    { "command": "inject", "options": { "actor": "Iris Founder", "handle": "@irisfounder", "action": "post", "content": "I am looking for a founder who has sold observability software to mid-sized hospitals. Can you search for a relevant person, and what evidence would make the match credible?" } },
